  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">R&#xe4;dda Barnen EU-Barn och migration 2012-15</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Children EU-Children and Migration 2012- 2016 - Save the Children EU-Children and Migration 2012-</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att f&#xe4;rre barn i s&#xf6;dra Afrika ska vara utsatta  f&#xf6;r v&#xe5;ld och utnyttjande som en konskvens av migration. Projektet ska &#xf6;ka samarbetet mellan nationella regeringar och regionala organisationer f&#xf6;r migrerande barns r&#xe4;ttigheter, samt ge st&#xf6;d till repatriering och s&#xe4;ker migration till 66 000 barn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is that by 2015, less children in Southern Africa suffer violence, abuse and exploitation as a result of         irregular migration. Commitment by national governments and regional bodies is a specific objective, along with support for repatriation and safe migration.</narrative>
  </description>
